sequenceDiagram
    participant Net as Server packets<br/>(network thread)
    participant Mix as ClientPacketListenerMixin<br/>(main thread, at RETURN)
    participant Rec as DuelRecorder
    participant Tick as END_CLIENT_TICK
    participant Ana as vertex-analysis thread
    participant Store as ReplayStore
    participant UI as Chat / ReplayScreen

    Net->>Mix: damage event, crit animation,<br/>attack sounds, velocity
    Mix->>Rec: CombatPackets.damage/animate/sound/motion<br/>(buffered as signals)
    Note over Rec: your click: AttackEntityCallback →<br/>onLocalAttack (records the client's prediction)
    loop every client tick
        Tick->>Rec: onEndClientTick
        Rec->>Rec: sample you + nearby entities → pre-roll buffer
        Rec->>Rec: resolve last tick's damage with<br/>sounds/crit from that tick and this one
        Rec->>Rec: append TickFrame, then check end conditions
    end
    Rec->>Ana: finish(): immutable DuelTrace
    Ana->>Ana: InteractionDetector → Explainer → ReplayDocument
    Ana->>Store: save .json.gz + index
    Ana->>UI: (back on main thread) chat summary + [Watch replay]
    UI->>UI: /vertex watch → ReplayScreen → GhostCast
